### Third-Party Assets & Licensing Notice

This repository bundles third-party vector chess piece artwork located in `frontend/src/assets/pieces/`.

- **Asset**: Staunton Chess Piece Vector Set (King, Queen, Rook, Bishop, Knight, Pawn for White and Black)
- **Creator / Artist**: Colin M. L. Burnett (Cburnett)
- **Source**: Wikimedia Commons / Lichess
